  "title": "Bran Muffins a la Brian",
  "description": "A bran muffin made with buttermilk and golden raisins. This is a recipe that is a combination of a variety of trials and errors. It is the only bran muffin recipe my husband likes.",
  "authors": [
    "Tammy"
